# What the Vercel CLI uploads. The MediaPipe runtime and the two models are
# regenerated by the prebuild step (from node_modules and Google's model
# store), so they stay home; the CLI uploads file by file with digests and no
# time cap, so the painted art and her voice lines travel with the source and
# the site depends on nothing else being online.
node_modules
dist
.netlify
.vercel
.sc
.secrets
.env
.env.*
Manager
public/mediapipe
public/models
netlify
test
